.TH SKILLKORP-TRAY 1 "2026-10-11" "skillkorp-suite 1.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
skillkorp-tray \- tray indicator for SkillKorp K20 and M20 devices
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B skillkorp-tray
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows the battery level of both devices, low battery notifications, quick
profile, lighting, DPI and polling rate switches, and switches profiles
automatically from the focused application. Only one instance runs per user.
.PP
It is started at login (\fI/etc/xdg/autostart\fP, can be turned off from its
menu or with \fBskillkorpctl autostart disable\fP) and by \fBskillkorp-gui\fP.
Its Quit item also closes the \fBskillkorp-gui\fP window.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SKILLKORP_NO_TRAY=1
Do not start the indicator from \fBskillkorp-gui\fP.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR skillkorpctl (1),
.BR skillkorp-gui (1)
